OL,4,CMiley Cyrus marries Maxx Morando in    
OL,5,CCalifornia ceremony                    
OL,6,GMiley Cyrus has married her partner of 
OL,7,Gfour years Maxx Morando during a       
OL,8,Gceremony in Palm Springs, California.  
OL,10,FA string of black and white photos     
OL,11,Fshared by the Flowers singer on        
OL,12,FInstagram showed the pair kissing      
OL,13,Fwhile surrounded by white roses.       
OL,15,FHer mother, Trisha Cyrus, and sister,  
OL,16,FNoah Cyrus, could be seen in the       
OL,17,Fbackground of one image. Her father    
OL,18,FBilly Ray Cyrus was not in the picture 
OL,19,Fbut was at the ceremony with his       
OL,20,Fpartner, actress Liz Hurley.           
